# The Fighting Fourth (crystalWar 7), the main path with no campaign allegiance: a level 99 Warrior in the Eldieme
# Necropolis [S] (missions as Steamed Rams' main flow). Turbulent Storm (script: 9 with an allegiance, 8 with the RED
# letter, else 7; its onEventFinish 7 on option 0 gives the Blue letter): nothing held: the quest's 7 (an Event),
# declined; the lookup's other turn: the script's 7, declined; the quest's 7, option 2: nothing; the script's 7,
# declined; the quest's 7, accepted: the Blue Recommendation Letter (the script's finish runs too: npcUtil.giveKeyItem
# sees the letter held); the script's 7 (it reads the RED letter), option 1; the letter held: the quest's 8; the
# script's 7 again. Bastok Markets [S]: Adelbrecht (an empty script): the letter: 139 (0, 0), options 0 and 2: nothing;
# option 1: the letter taken, the Battle Rations, begun. Prog 0: 140, options 0 and 2: nothing. North Gustaberg [S]:
# Roderich at Prog 0: nil (default 111); the Barricade: nil (NO_WAY_PAST_BARRIER); Gebhardt 102, finished: the rations
# taken, Prog 1; 103. The Barricade at Prog 1: nil. Bastok Markets [S]: Adelbrecht 141, option 0: nothing. North
# Gustaberg [S]: Roderich 104, finished: Prog 2; 105. Bastok Markets [S]: Adelbrecht 142, option 0: nothing. North
# Gustaberg [S]: Gebhardt 107; the Barricade 106, finished: Prog 3; Roderich 109; Gebhardt 108. Bastok Markets [S]:
# Adelbrecht 143, finished: the Sprinter's Shoes, completed (Fourth Division Soldier), the Bronze Ribbon of Service,
# allegiance 2, NOW_ALLIED_WITH 2. Completed: Adelbrecht 162, twice; Gebhardt 108, Roderich 109, the Barricade nil
# (NO_WAY_PAST_BARRIER); Turbulent Storm: the quest's 9 (replaceDefault), then the script's 9.
lists TheEldiemeNecropolisS/Turbulent_Storm/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolisS/onEventFinish/7 BastokMarketsS/Adelbrecht/onTrigger BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/139 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/140 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/142 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/143 NorthGustabergS/Gebhardt/onTrigger NorthGustabergS/Roderich/onTrigger NorthGustabergS/Barricade/onTrigger NorthGustabergS/onEventFinish/102 NorthGustabergS/onEventFinish/104 NorthGustabergS/onEventFinish/106
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolisS pos=423.961,-48,-47.308 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # nothing held: the quest's 7; the mission takes no talk
finish option=1                         # declined: nothing
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the lookup's other turn: the script's 7 (no RED letter)
finish option=1                         # nothing
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the quest's 7
finish option=2                         # nothing (the quest's finish and the script's)
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the script's 7
finish option=1                         # nothing
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the quest's 7
finish option=0                         # the Blue Recommendation Letter (the script's finish sees it held)
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the script's 7 (it reads the RED letter)
finish option=1                         # nothing
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the letter: the quest's 8
finish
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the script's 7
finish option=1
warp -324.266,-12.601,-76.977 BastokMarketsS
trigger Adelbrecht                      # the letter: 139 (0, 0)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Adelbrecht                      # 139 (0, 0)
finish option=2                         # nothing
trigger Adelbrecht                      # 139 (0, 0)
finish option=1                         # the letter taken; the Battle Rations; begun
trigger Adelbrecht                      # Prog 0: 140
